  calc ipO μ 𝓕 (om (oneP θ S τ (BS τ * YS * (BS τ)⁻¹) (-t), oneP θ T τ (BT τ * YT * (BT τ)⁻¹) (-t)) f) g
      = ipO μ 𝓕 (om (atTau θ S τ (sS τ), atTau θ T τ (sT τ))
